    <briefdescription>
<para>C++ source file with non-template implementations for the µTest++ expression formatter. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This source file contains the non-template <computeroutput>operator&lt;&lt;</computeroutput> overloads of <computeroutput>expression_formatter</computeroutput> for all standard arithmetic, character, string, boolean, and null-pointer types. Each overload appends the formatted value — together with an appropriate type suffix where applicable — to the internal string buffer.</para>
<para>All definitions reside within the <computeroutput><ref refid="namespacemicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus" kindref="compound">micro_os_plus::micro_test_plus</ref></computeroutput> namespace.</para>
<para>This file must be included when building the µTest++ library. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
